        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Where this dish lives"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Bhindi masala is a favourite way to cook okra. The dry style keeps it bright and savoury. It needs care to avoid sliminess. Serve it with dal and roti. It is a side that wins over okra doubters."
          }
        ]
      }
